<item><title>Sudan&apos;s army faces accusations after drone hits school sheltering displaced people in W...</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-s-army-faces-accusations-after-drone-hits-school-612e1f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/sd/sudan-s-army-faces-accusations-after-drone-hits-school-612e1f/</guid><category>Sudan</category><description>Kordofan Observatory says a drone struck the Musab bin Umair Western School in Ghubaysh, which was sheltering hundreds displaced by fighting around En Nuhud, killing 16.</description><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:03:56 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" length="31568" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/sd.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
